{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/DIVIDER_CITY.png?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Santheria Uprising</strong> is a <strong>deck-building game where tactics, timing, and upgrades play a crucial role</strong>. The fate of an oppressed people lies in the hands of a band of rebels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/library_hero_Ref.png?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/DIVIDER_SMALL.png?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lead a party of four characters</strong> fighting for the rebellion as they march toward the city of the mighty Celestials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face monstrous beasts, brigands, soldiers, and creatures magically transformed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose your strategy and carefully plan your moves to defend against enemies,only you can change the future of <strong>Santheria</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/Fight__1.gif?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from eight unique characters to build your party, each with their own unique abilities. Will you opt for an aggressive playstyle, or would you rather weak<strong>en your enemies over time?</strong> With over 70 party combinations, countless strategies await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you hide in the shadows and poison your enemies with the Rogue, or unleash devastation with Mage\u2019s  spells? Will you rely on the Engineer\u2019s gadgets or on the Warrior\u2019s relentless strikes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Tank to Protect your team and summon the Huntress\u2019 allies. You'll be able to manipulate time and to heal your comrades with the Healer, but also to slow down and annihilate your foes with the Witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/Character_Selection.gif?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/DIVIDER_SMALL.png?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use wisely the power of <strong>Orbs</strong>, small artifacts infused with ancient  powers, to shape each character\u2019s playstyle and prepare them for the toughest challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By visiting <strong>Temples</strong> around Santherya, you'll manage, merge and upgrade these powerful magical artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/Temple.gif?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the <strong>Shaman\u2019s tent</strong> to upgrade your most useful cards or remove those you no longer need. Define each character\u2019s combat style and improve it with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consult the<strong> Fortune Teller</strong> to see what fate has in store for the rebels\u2014will they gain new powers and wonderful advantages, or will misfortune make their journey even tougher?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/fortune_teller___new_for_gif.gif?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/DIVIDER_SMALL.png?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The experience is further enriched by high-quality visuals, with carefully crafted characters, enemies, and environments that immerse players in a stunning fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/join_discord_banner.png?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay in touch with the developers and share tips and strategies with other players to defeat the Celestials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/DIVIDER_CITY.png?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499700?t=1744912019","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744912019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/63606e880cec2081b952db0c6fae9fd9415d454b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744912019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/63606e880cec2081b952db0c6fae9fd9415d454b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744912019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/DIVIDER_CITY.png