 visuals, with carefully crafted characters, enemies, and environments that immerse players in a stunning fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/join_discord_banner.png?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay in touch with the developers and share tips and strategies with other players to defeat the Celestials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/extras/DIVIDER_CITY.png?t=1744912019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>","developers":["The Portal srl"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499700/header.jpg?t=1744912019","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127378,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127378/movie480.mp4?t=1744912015","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127378/movie_max.mp4?t=1744912015"},"name":"Alpha Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127378/4c7ca3f31bbafc6aba5a89ef4fda9514a3b6cc9a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744912015","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127378/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744912015","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127378/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744912015"}}],"name":"Santherya Uprising","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\